Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:05:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mobile): return EIP-1193 errors to the dApp

- A rejected sign request resolves with 4001 "User Rejected Request"
  instead of throwing.
- An unsupported method resolves with 4200 "Unsupported Method".
- A second sign request while one is pending throws and leaves the
  first one pending.
- Disconnecting or leaving the screen closes the session and settles a
  pending request with 4900 "Disconnected".
- OpenLVGlobals is mounted in the container so the crypto WebView stays
  mounted during a sign request.
